{"ticker":"SO","updated":"2026-10-30T23:13:02Z","profile":{"longName":"The Southern Company","shortName":"Southern Company (The)","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.southerncompany.com","fullTimeEmployees":29502,"marketCap":107800518656,"trailingPE":22.580723,"forwardPE":19.046902,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.5720375,"pegRatio":2.2,"targetMeanPrice":95.9,"targetHighPrice":112.0,"targetLowPrice":74.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.001,"earningsGrowth":0.304,"grossMargins":0.48289,"operatingMargins":0.29612,"profitMargins":0.15435,"totalRevenue":30179000320,"beta":0.301,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":99.58,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":81.69,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.27},"summary":"The Southern Company, through its subsidiaries, engages in the sale of electricity. The company offers electric service to retail customers and wholesale customers; and energy-related products and services to natural gas choice markets. It also develops, constructs, acquires, owns, operates, and manages power generation assets, as well as battery energy storage projects; sells electricity at market-based rates in the wholesale market; and deploys microgrids for commercial, industrial, governmental, and utility customers. In addition, the company is involved in the distribution of natural gas in Illinois, Georgia, Virginia, and Tennessee; distributes energy and resilience solutions; and invests in telecommunications. The Southern Company was incorporated in 1945 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","summary_zh":"南方公司透過其子公司從事電力銷售業務。本公司為零售客戶和批發客戶提供電力服務；以及向天然氣選擇市場提供能源相關產品和服務。它還開發、建造、收購、擁有、營運和管理發電資產以及電池儲能項目；在批發市場以市場價格銷售電力；並為商業、工業、政府和公用事業客戶部署微電網。此外，該公司還參與伊利諾伊州、喬治亞州、維吉尼亞州和田納西州的天然氣分銷業務；分發能源和彈性解決方案；並投資電信。南方公司成立於 1945 年，總部位於喬治亞州亞特蘭大。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":92.24,"h":92.82,"l":91.63,"c":92.