r accounts affected by Southern Company data breach","src":"WBRC","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-05","zh":"近 10 萬個阿拉巴馬電力帳戶受到南方公司資料外洩的影響"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/92122/000009212226000006/so-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Southern Company is a holding company that owns all of the outstanding common stock of three traditional electric operating companies, Southern Power Company, and Southern Company Gas.","zh":""},{"en":"The traditional electric operating companies – Alabama Power, Georgia Power, and Mississippi Power – are each vertically integrated utilities providing electric service to retail customers in three Southeastern states in addition to wholesale customers in the Southeast.","zh":""},{"en":"Southern Power Company is an operating public utility company. The term \"Southern Power\" when used herein refers to Southern Power Company and its subsidiaries, while the term \"Southern Power Company\" when used herein refers only to the Southern Power parent company. Southern Power develops, constructs, acquires, owns, operates, and manages power generation assets, including battery energy storage projects, and sells electricity at market-based rates in the wholesale market.","zh":""}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Gas pipeline investments primarily consists of joint ventures in natural gas pipeline investments including a 50% interest in SNG and a 50% joint ownership interest in the Dalton Pipeline. These natural gas pipelines enable the provision of diverse sources of natural gas supplies to the customers of Southern Company Gas. SNG, the largest natural gas pipeline investment, is the owner of a 7,000-mile pipeline connecting natural gas supply basins in Texas, Louisiana, Mississippi, and Alabama to markets in Louisiana, Mississippi, Alabama, Florida, Georgia, South Carolina, and Tennessee. SNG is developing a proposed pipeline project, designed to meet customer demand by increasing SNG's existing pipeline capacity by approximately 1.3 billion cubic feet per day, which the operator of the joint venture anticipates will be completed by 2029. The ultimate outcome of this matter cannot be determine","zh":"天然氣管道投資主要包括天然氣管道投資的合資企業，包括SNG 50%的權益和Dalton Pipeline 50%的共同所有權權益。這些天然氣管道能夠為南方天然氣公司的客戶提供多種來源的天然氣供應。 SNG 是最大的天然气管道投资公司，拥有一条 7,000 英里长的管道，将德克萨斯州、路易斯安那州、密西西比州和阿拉巴马州的天然气供应盆地与路易斯安那州、密西西比州、阿拉巴马州、佛罗里达州、佐治亚州、南卡罗来纳州和田纳西州的市场连接起来。 SNG正在开发一个拟议的管道项目，旨在通过将SNG现有的管道容量增加约13亿立方英尺/天来满足客户需求，合资企业的运营商预计该项目将于2029年完成。此事的最终结果无法确定"}],"competition":[{"en":"The electric utility industry in the United States is continuing to evolve as a result of regulatory, projected demand requirements, and competitive factors. The competition for retail energy sales among competing suppliers of energy is influenced by various factors, including price, availability, technological advancements, service, and reliability. These factors are, in turn, affected by, among other influences, regulatory, political, and environmental considerations, taxation, and supply.","zh":""},{"en":"The retail service rights of all electric suppliers in the state of Georgia are regulated by the Territorial Electric Service Act of 1973. Pursuant to standards set forth in this Act, the Georgia PSC has assigned substantially all of the land area in the state to a supplier. Notwithstanding such assignments, this Act provides that any new customer locating outside of 1973 municipal limits and having a connected load of at least 900 KWs may exercise a one-time choice for the life of the premises to receive electric service from the supplier of its choice.","zh":""}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Traditional Electric Operating Companies & Southern Power","val":23777000000,"zh":"Traditional Electric Operating Companies & Southern Power"},{"name":"Electric Utilities","val":23777000000,"zh":"Electric Utilities"},{"name":"Traditional Electric Operating Companies","val":22056000000,"zh":"Traditional Electric Operating Companies"},{"name":"Southern Company Gas","val":5044000000,"zh":"Southern Company Gas"},{"name":"Southern Power","val":2198000000,"zh":"Southern Power"}],"total":29553000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Retail Electric","val":19764000000,"zh":"Retail Electric"},{"name":"Retail","val":19331000000,"zh":"零售"},{"name":"Retail Electric Residential","val":8601000000,"zh":"零售 電氣 住宅"},{"name":"Retail Electric Commercial","val":6995000000,"zh":"零售 電力 商業"},{"name":"Natural Gas","val":5044000000,"zh":"天然氣"},{"name":"Natural Gas Distribution","val":4454000000,"zh":"天然氣配送"},{"name":"Retail Electric Industrial","val":4045000000,"zh":"零售 電氣 工業"},{"name":"Wholesale Electric","val":2941000000,"zh":"批發電器"},{"name":"Wholesale Electric Revenues","val":2366000000,"zh":"批發電力收入"},{"name":"Natural Gas Distribution Residential","val":2164000000,"zh":"天然氣配送 住宅"}],"total":29553000000}},"peers":["DUK","D","AEP","ED","EXC"]}}